item+ enum crates/phextron-web/src/json.rs :: Json :: pub enum Json { :: A parsed JSON value. Objects keep insertion order (the console's renderers iterate fixed key lists, so order is cosmetic, but fidelity costs nothing). Numbers keep their raw lexeme for storage; display renders them the way the desktop shell's JS does — through the numeric value, JS-style (`8.0` shows as `8`) — and arithmetic parses on demand. :: direct :: api
